{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2021-09-14 16:15:00', 'title': 'DANAHER ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'WASHINGTON, SEPT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.21 PER SHARE OF ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 29, 2021 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2021.'}